      "side": 1,
      "message": "IIUC this patch might sometimes keep the HAL running as long as there\u0027s any USB device at all plugged in.\n\n- Without trying to map USB devices to camera IDs - would it be straightforward enough to just have the provider asynchronously report when it\u0027s not managing any cameras any more? So\n  - When device is attached, always try to start the provider\n  - When device is detached, do nothing until the provider comes back with `cameraDeviceStatusChange`\n\n- I\u0027m not sure whether the team is actively supporting the area any more (I know they would be unhappy to lose the memory optimisation from having a lazy hal, but not sure if there is motivation to fix the case of unplugging 1/2 plugged cameras)",
